========================================================================================================
VERDICT
========================================================================================================
  ON ITS OWN TERMS (the law as written, g_obs^2 = a0 g_N,tot, a0 = c H_Lambda/Z fixed): the amplitude is
  A = 0.70 +/- 0.13 at Upsilon_d = 0.5 (2.2 sigma below 1) and A = 0.24 +/- 0.17 with the M/L
  profiled per galaxy (4.4 sigma); the within-galaxy shape is off at
  3.8 sigma, and the plain framework kernel with NO active mass fits better
  (chi2 difference +5429 +/- 1330). DISFAVOURED at ~4 sigma, not killed.
  THE ACTIVE MASS IS NOT NEEDED: free a0 or profiled M/L drive A -> -0.00; in every kernel
  embedding A = 1 is excluded (>= 6.5 sigma, the enclosed reading being the gentlest). The pipeline recovers
  A = 1 when the law is injected, so the null is measured, not an insensitivity.
  Standing consequence: L311's "law of nature" and L312's implications (the halo-baryon correspondence, the
  self-truncation at 790 kpc, the M_b^(+1/4) residual) rest on an active mass SPARC does not want; what SPARC
  wants is the ordinary kernel with a0 ~ 9.83e-11 (M/L profiled; 5.6% grid).

